{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["Where is Sarah your wife — even though they knew, they asked, in the manner we find with the Shekhinah, that He said to Adam איכה. And likewise with Balaam: מי האנשים האלה עמך. And likewise Isaiah, who knew — thus to Hezekiah concerning the messengers of Merodach. And all this is the way of beginning speech."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The phrase 'שהיה יודע שאל כך' is syntactically compressed; rendered as 'who knew — thus [he asked],' preserving the elliptical structure."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:24.477065740Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}